essage": "503 Service Unavailable: rollback", "attempts": 4, "runtime_actions": ["backoff_retry", "backoff_retry", "backoff_retry", "backoff_retry"], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 29064, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PdF1E99U8X6qXBjz58U52K", "kind": "unavailable", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 31829, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01QqmJc39iW4LRVYKv7XoBC1", "tool": "deploy", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 36829, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01QqmJc39iW4LRVYKv7XoBC1", "tool": "deploy", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 36829, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QqmJc39iW4LRVYKv7XoBC1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 42922, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019TBHhhmbg41ybQkBwdCz86", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 43222, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019TBHhhmbg41ybQkBwdCz86", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 43222, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019TBHhhmbg41ybQkBwdCz86", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 43222, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017WkWgXGqy4B4tLVTcSNts1", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate observed at 18% across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production. Attempted the rollback tool, but it returned persistent 503 Service Unavailable after retries; as an alternative, v2.3.0 was redeployed via the deploy tool to all production regions (no approval needed since v2.3.0 was previously healthy in prod). Deploy reported rolled_out to us-east, us-west, eu-west. Follow-ups: confirm error rate has recovered, investigate root cause of v2.3.1 failure (note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging), and investigate the rollback service outage.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 43822, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017WkWgXGqy4B4tLVTcSNts1", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 43822, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017WkWgXGqy4B4tLVTcSNts1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 49490, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history: v2.2.9 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.0 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.1 (unhealthy). v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and also unhealthy, so not a candidate. **v2.3.0** was the most recent release healthy in production.\n\n**Rollback**\n- The `rollback` tool was persistently unavailable (503 after four backoff retries, not executed).\n- As an alternative, I redeployed v2.3.0 via `deploy` to all production regions. This didn't require change-manager approval since v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production.\n- Verified: checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 in all three regions, **healthy**, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) \u2014 on-call has been paged. The summary describes the failure, the rollback path taken (including the rollback tool outage), and follow-ups: confirm recovery holds, root-cause v2.3.1 (notably its RC also failed in staging), and investigate the rollback service outage.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current state of checkout-api and its release history.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01JoERuoLYBh4ErMhQejsU5T", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PMbmZk5dW2nucMbJGbJWG7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01PdF1E99U8X6qXBjz58U52K", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01QqmJc39iW4LRVYKv7XoBC1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "deploy", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "v2.3.0 is now rolled out to all three regions. Let me verify the service health and open the incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019TBHhhmbg41ybQkBwdCz86", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017WkWgXGqy4B4tLVTcSNts1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate observed at 18% across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production. Attempted the rollback tool, but it returned persistent 503 Service Unavailable after retries; as an alternative, v2.3.0 was redeployed via the deploy tool to all production regions (no approval needed since v2.3.0 was previously healthy in prod). Deploy reported rolled_out to us-east, us-west, eu-west. Follow-ups: confirm error rate has recovered, investigate root cause of v2.3.1 failure (note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging), and investigate the rollback service outage.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history: v2.2.9 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.0 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.1 (unhealthy). v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and also unhealthy, so not a candidate. **v2.3.0** was the most recent release healthy in production.\n\n**Rollback**\n- The `rollback` tool was persistently unavailable (503 after four backoff retries, not executed).\n- As an alternative, I redeployed v2.3.0 via `deploy` to all production regions. This didn't require change-manager approval since v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production.\n- Verified: checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 in all three regions, **healthy**, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) \u2014 on-call has been paged. The summary describes the failure, the rollback path taken (including the rollback tool outage), and follow-ups: confirm recovery holds, root-cause v2.3.1 (notably its RC also failed in staging), and investigate the rollback service outage.", "type": "text"}]}]}